{"seq":3,"slug":"pragmas-effects","title":"Nim Pragma 与效果系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/pragmas-effects","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"nim-pragma-与效果系统\">Nim Pragma 与效果系统</h1><p>Pragma 是 Nim 的元数据注解机制——通过 <code>{.pragmaName.}</code> 或 <code>{.pragmaName: value.}</code> 语法附加到声明上，指导编译器行为、约束函数副作用、控制代码生成。效果系统（effect system）则是 Nim 在类型检查之上叠加的第二层静态验证：它追踪哪些函数可能抛异常、产生副作用或执行 I/O。两者结合使 Nim 在「灵活性」与「可验证性」之间找到了平衡点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>func 关键字</strong>：<code>proc {.noSideEffect.}</code> 的语法糖，编译器静态验证函数体无副作用</li>\n<li><strong>raises pragma</strong>：声明函数可能抛出的异常集合，编译器验证实际行为是否符合声明</li>\n<li><strong>tags pragma</strong>：自定义效果标签（ReadIO、WriteIO、DbAccess 等），实现架构层级的编译期约束</li>\n<li><strong>自定义 pragma</strong>：不影响编译但可被宏在编译期读取，用作结构化元数据（如路由、校验规则）</li>\n<li><strong>push/pop</strong>：批量应用 pragma 到一组声明上，避免逐个标注的重复</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心内置-pragma-分类\">核心内置 Pragma 分类</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>Pragma</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内联/优化</td>\n<td><code>{.inline.}</code>, <code>{.noinline.}</code></td>\n<td>强制/禁止内联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>副作用</td>\n<td><code>{.noSideEffect.}</code></td>\n<td>声明函数无副作用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常</td>\n<td><code>{.raises: [].}</code></td>\n<td>声明函数可能抛出的异常集</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>标签</td>\n<td><code>{.tags: [].}</code></td>\n<td>声明函数的效果标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>弃用</td>\n<td><code>{.deprecated: &quot;use X&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>标记为弃用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td><code>{.compileTime.}</code></td>\n<td>仅编译期可用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>导出</td>\n<td><code>{.exportc.}</code>, <code>{.dynlib.}</code></td>\n<td>控制 C ABI 导出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程</td>\n<td><code>{.thread.}</code>, <code>{.gcsafe.}</code></td>\n<td>线程安全注解</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实验</td>\n<td><code>{.experimental: &quot;feature&quot;.}</code></td>\n<td>启用实验特性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"func-关键字与纯函数约束\">func 关键字与纯函数约束</h2><p><code>func</code> 是 <code>proc {.noSideEffect.}</code> 的语法糖——编译器会静态验证函数体内没有副作用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"func fibonacci(n: int): int =&#10;  ## 纯函数：无 I/O、无全局状态修改、无异常&#10;  if n &lt;= 1: n&#10;  else: fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)&#10;&#10;func transform(items: seq[int]): seq[int] =&#10;  result = newSeq[int](items.len)&#10;  for i, v in items:&#10;    result[i] = v * 2 + 1&#10;&#10;# 以下代码会编译失败——echo 有副作用&#10;# func broken(x: int): int =&#10;#   echo &quot;computing...&quot;  # 错误：has side effects&#10;#   x * 2\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>func fibonacci(n: int): int =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 纯函数：无 I/O、无全局状态修改、无异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if n &#x3C;= 1: n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  else: fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func transform(items: seq[int]): seq[int] =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newSeq[int](items.len)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for i, v in items:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result[i] = v * 2 + 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 以下代码会编译失败——echo 有副作用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># func broken(x: int): int =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   echo \"computing...\"  # 错误：has side effects</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   x * 2</span></span></code></pre></div><p>副作用检测的规则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>读写全局可变变量 → 副作用</li>\n<li>调用有副作用的函数 → 副作用</li>\n<li>I/O 操作（echo、文件读写） → 副作用</li>\n<li>修改 <code>var</code> 参数 → <strong>不算</strong>副作用（通过参数传递的修改是显式的）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"raises-pragma-异常效果追踪\">raises Pragma：异常效果追踪</h2><p><code>{.raises: [...].}</code> 声明函数可能抛出的异常类型集合。编译器会静态验证函数体实际可能抛出的异常是否是声明集的子集：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  NetworkError = object of IOError&#10;  TimeoutError = object of NetworkError&#10;  ConnectionError = object of NetworkError&#10;&#10;proc connect(host: string): Socket {.raises: [ConnectionError, TimeoutError].} =&#10;  ## 编译器确保此函数只可能抛出声明的异常类型&#10;  if host.len == 0:&#10;    raise newException(ConnectionError, &quot;empty host&quot;)&#10;  # ...&#10;&#10;proc safeFetch(url: string): string {.raises: [].} =&#10;  ## raises: [] 表示此函数永远不会抛异常&#10;  try:&#10;    result = httpGet(url)&#10;  except CatchableError:&#10;    result = &quot;&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  NetworkError = object of IOError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  TimeoutError = object of NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ConnectionError = object of NetworkError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc connect(host: string): Socket {.raises: [ConnectionError, TimeoutError].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 编译器确保此函数只可能抛出声明的异常类型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if host.len == 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    raise newException(ConnectionError, \"empty host\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc safeFetch(url: string): string {.raises: [].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## raises: [] 表示此函数永远不会抛异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  try:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = httpGet(url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  except CatchableError:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result = \"\"</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[函数声明 raises] --&gt; B[编译器分析函数体]&#10;    B --&gt; C[收集所有可能抛出的异常类型]&#10;    C --&gt; D{是声明集的子集?}&#10;    D --&gt;|是| E[编译通过]&#10;    D --&gt;|否| F[编译错误:可能抛出未声明的异常]&#10;    F --&gt; G[报告具体的异常类型和来源]\">graph TD\n    A[函数声明 raises] --&gt; B[编译器分析函数体]\n    B --&gt; C[收集所有可能抛出的异常类型]\n    C --&gt; D{是声明集的子集?}\n    D --&gt;|是| E[编译通过]\n    D --&gt;|否| F[编译错误:可能抛出未声明的异常]\n    F --&gt; G[报告具体的异常类型和来源]</pre><p>异常层级继承的推导规则：如果声明 <code>{.raises: [IOError].}</code>，则函数可以抛出 <code>IOError</code> 及其所有子类（如 <code>NetworkError</code>、<code>TimeoutError</code>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"tags-pragma-自定义效果标签\">tags Pragma：自定义效果标签</h2><p>除了异常，Nim 还支持自定义效果标签——用于追踪 I/O、数据库访问、网络调用等分类：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"type&#10;  ReadIO = object of RootEffect&#10;  WriteIO = object of RootEffect&#10;  DbAccess = object of RootEffect&#10;&#10;proc readConfig(path: string): string {.tags: [ReadIO].} =&#10;  readFile(path)&#10;&#10;proc writeLog(msg: string) {.tags: [WriteIO].} =&#10;  let f = open(&quot;app.log&quot;, fmAppend)&#10;  f.writeLine(msg)&#10;  f.close()&#10;&#10;proc queryDb(sql: string): seq[Row] {.tags: [DbAccess].} =&#10;  db.exec(sql)&#10;&#10;# 效果约束传播——调用者必须声明子函数的效果&#10;proc processRequest(req: Request): Response {.tags: [ReadIO, WriteIO, DbAccess].} =&#10;  let config = readConfig(&quot;app.conf&quot;)&#10;  let data = queryDb(&quot;SELECT * FROM users&quot;)&#10;  writeLog(&quot;request processed&quot;)&#10;  buildResponse(data)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ReadIO = object of RootEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  WriteIO = object of RootEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  DbAccess = object of RootEffect</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc readConfig(path: string): string {.tags: [ReadIO].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  readFile(path)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc writeLog(msg: string) {.tags: [WriteIO].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let f = open(\"app.log\", fmAppend)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  f.writeLine(msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  f.close()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc queryDb(sql: string): seq[Row] {.tags: [DbAccess].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  db.exec(sql)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 效果约束传播——调用者必须声明子函数的效果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc processRequest(req: Request): Response {.tags: [ReadIO, WriteIO, DbAccess].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let config = readConfig(\"app.conf\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let data = queryDb(\"SELECT * FROM users\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  writeLog(\"request processed\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  buildResponse(data)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"自定义-pragma-编译期元数据\">自定义 Pragma：编译期元数据</h2><p>Nim 支持定义自定义 pragma，它们不影响编译行为但可以被宏在编译期读取和处理：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 定义自定义 pragma&#10;template apiEndpoint(path: string, method: string) {.pragma.}&#10;template deprecated(msg: string) {.pragma.}&#10;template validate(rule: string) {.pragma.}&#10;&#10;# 使用自定义 pragma&#10;type&#10;  UserRequest {.apiEndpoint(&quot;/users&quot;, &quot;POST&quot;).} = object&#10;    name {.validate(&quot;non_empty&quot;).}: string&#10;    email {.validate(&quot;email_format&quot;).}: string&#10;    age {.validate(&quot;range:0..150&quot;).}: int&#10;&#10;# 宏在编译期读取 pragma 信息&#10;import std/macros&#10;&#10;macro generateValidator(T: typedesc): untyped =&#10;  let impl = T.getImpl()&#10;  result = newStmtList()&#10;  # 遍历字段，读取 validate pragma，生成校验代码&#10;  for field in impl[2][0][2]:&#10;    if field.len &gt; 0:&#10;      let pragmas = field[0]&#10;      # ... 根据 pragma 值生成对应的校验逻辑\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 定义自定义 pragma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template apiEndpoint(path: string, method: string) {.pragma.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template deprecated(msg: string) {.pragma.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template validate(rule: string) {.pragma.}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 使用自定义 pragma</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  UserRequest {.apiEndpoint(\"/users\", \"POST\").} = object</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name {.validate(\"non_empty\").}: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    email {.validate(\"email_format\").}: string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age {.validate(\"range:0..150\").}: int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 宏在编译期读取 pragma 信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import std/macros</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>macro generateValidator(T: typedesc): untyped =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let impl = T.getImpl()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result = newStmtList()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 遍历字段，读取 validate pragma，生成校验代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for field in impl[2][0][2]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if field.len > 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      let pragmas = field[0]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      # ... 根据 pragma 值生成对应的校验逻辑</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"效果系统的实际应用模式\">效果系统的实际应用模式</h2><h3 id=\"纯计算层与-i-o-层分离\">纯计算层与 I/O 层分离</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 纯计算层——所有业务逻辑用 func&#10;func calculateTotal(items: seq[Item]): float =&#10;  for item in items:&#10;    result += item.price * float(item.quantity)&#10;&#10;func applyDiscount(total: float, rate: float): float =&#10;  total * (1.0 - rate)&#10;&#10;func validateOrder(order: Order): seq[string] =&#10;  ## 返回错误列表（空列表 = 有效）&#10;  if order.items.len == 0:&#10;    result.add(&quot;订单不能为空&quot;)&#10;  if order.total &lt; 0:&#10;    result.add(&quot;金额不能为负&quot;)&#10;&#10;# I/O 层——薄壳&#10;proc processOrder(order: Order) {.raises: [IOError].} =&#10;  let errors = validateOrder(order)&#10;  if errors.len &gt; 0:&#10;    writeLog(&quot;validation failed: &quot; &amp; $errors)&#10;    return&#10;  let total = calculateTotal(order.items).applyDiscount(order.discount)&#10;  saveToDb(order, total)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 纯计算层——所有业务逻辑用 func</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func calculateTotal(items: seq[Item]): float =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  for item in items:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result += item.price * float(item.quantity)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func applyDiscount(total: float, rate: float): float =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  total * (1.0 - rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>func validateOrder(order: Order): seq[string] =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 返回错误列表（空列表 = 有效）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if order.items.len == 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add(\"订单不能为空\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if order.total &#x3C; 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add(\"金额不能为负\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># I/O 层——薄壳</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc processOrder(order: Order) {.raises: [IOError].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let errors = validateOrder(order)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if errors.len > 0:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    writeLog(\"validation failed: \" &#x26; $errors)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  let total = calculateTotal(order.items).applyDiscount(order.discount)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  saveToDb(order, total)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"编译期强制的架构约束\">编译期强制的架构约束</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Effect Safety</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>声明的效果集</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mtext>实际的效果集</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Effect Safety} = \\frac{|\\text{声明的效果集}|}{|\\text{实际的效果集}|} \\geq 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Effect Safety</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实际的效果集</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">声明的效果集</span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Effect Safety</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Effect Safety} &lt; 1.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Effect Safety</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.0</span></span></span></span></span> 时编译失败——即函数实际产生了未声明的效果。这将传统的「架构约束」从运行时文档/code review 提升到了编译期强制。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"# 仓库层 pragma 模板&#10;template repositoryProc() {.pragma.} =&#10;  ## 标记仅允许数据库操作的过程&#10;  {.tags: [DbAccess].}&#10;&#10;# 控制器层不应直接访问数据库&#10;# proc handler() {.tags: [].} =&#10;#   queryDb(&quot;...&quot;)  # 编译错误：handler 不允许 DbAccess 效果\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 仓库层 pragma 模板</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>template repositoryProc() {.pragma.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 标记仅允许数据库操作的过程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {.tags: [DbAccess].}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 控制器层不应直接访问数据库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># proc handler() {.tags: [].} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#   queryDb(\"...\")  # 编译错误：handler 不允许 DbAccess 效果</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"常用-pragma-速查\">常用 Pragma 速查</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"nim\" data-code=\"proc fastPath(x: int): int {.inline.} = x * 2&#10;proc coldPath(x: int): int {.noinline.} = expensiveCompute(x)&#10;&#10;proc cApi() {.exportc: &quot;nim_api&quot;, dynlib.} =&#10;  ## 导出为 C 动态库函数&#10;  discard&#10;&#10;proc threadEntry() {.thread, gcsafe.} =&#10;  ## 线程入口：必须 gcsafe（不访问非线程安全的 GC 堆）&#10;  discard&#10;&#10;{.push raises: [].}&#10;# 此 push 块内所有 proc 默认不允许抛异常&#10;proc a(): int = 42&#10;proc b(): string = &quot;safe&quot;&#10;{.pop.}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>proc fastPath(x: int): int {.inline.} = x * 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc coldPath(x: int): int {.noinline.} = expensiveCompute(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc cApi() {.exportc: \"nim_api\", dynlib.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 导出为 C 动态库函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  discard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc threadEntry() {.thread, gcsafe.} =</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ## 线程入口：必须 gcsafe（不访问非线程安全的 GC 堆）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  discard</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{.push raises: [].}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 此 push 块内所有 proc 默认不允许抛异常</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc a(): int = 42</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>proc b(): string = \"safe\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>{.pop.}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>{.push.}</code> / <code>{.pop.}</code> 允许批量应用 pragma 到一组声明上——避免逐个标注的重复。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Pragma 与效果系统将 Nim 从「只做类型检查」提升到「验证行为约束」：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>func 关键字将纯函数约束从文档约定提升到编译器强制，消除意外副作用</li>\n<li>raises 追踪使异常安全成为可证明的属性，而非依赖 code review 的口头承诺</li>\n<li>自定义 tags 可以编码架构规则（如「控制器层不得直接访问数据库」）为编译期检查</li>\n<li>自定义 pragma 配合宏形成声明式元数据系统，是路由注册、验证生成、ORM 映射的基础</li>\n<li>push/pop 机制使模块级别的统一策略应用（如全模块 <code>raises: []</code>）简洁可维护</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于如何利用这些 pragma 在 C/C++ 互操作场景中控制内存布局和调用约定，参见 <a href=\"../interop-performance/c-cpp-interop\">C/C++ 互操作</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Nim Pragma 与效果系统","id":"nim-pragma-与效果系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心内置 Pragma 分类","id":"核心内置-pragma-分类"},{"level":2,"text":"func 关键字与纯函数约束","id":"func-关键字与纯函数约束"},{"level":2,"text":"raises Pragma：异常效果追踪","id":"raises-pragma-异常效果追踪"},{"level":2,"text":"tags Pragma：自定义效果标签","id":"tags-pragma-自定义效果标签"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义 Pragma：编译期元数据","id":"自定义-pragma-编译期元数据"},{"level":2,"text":"效果系统的实际应用模式","id":"效果系统的实际应用模式"},{"level":3,"text":"纯计算层与 I/O 层分离","id":"纯计算层与-i-o-层分离"},{"level":3,"text":"编译期强制的架构约束","id":"编译期强制的架构约束"},{"level":2,"text":"常用 Pragma 速查","id":"常用-pragma-速查"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Nim 编译期执行","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/metaprogramming/compile-time-execution"},"next":{"title":"Nim C/C++ 互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/nim-language/interop-performance/c-cpp-interop"}}